 "gates": [
  {"id": "g1", "day": "d14", "text": "Gate 1, Plan A, after mock 3. Mocks 2 and 3 both 80% or more: you are ahead, and mock 5 is optional. Mock 3 under 65%: move the exam now and switch to Plan B. Anything between: continue Plan A."},
  {"id": "g2", "day": "d17", "text": "Gate 2, Plan A, after mock 5, decided this evening. Last two mocks both 80% or more: go (the strict rule). Last two mocks both 75% or more, no domain under 65%, and mock 5 finished with 10 minutes left: go (the softer rule). Anything lower: move the exam and switch to Plan B."},
  {"id": "g3", "day": "d11", "text": "Plan C gate, after mock 2. Mock 1 under 70% or mock 2 under 75%: move the exam to Day 19; do Plan A Days 13 to 17 on Days 12 to 16 (skip what you already did), a light day on Day 17, then Plan A Days 18 and 19."},
  {"id": "g4", "day": "d01", "text": "Plan choice. Choose Plan C only if your official practice set is 70% or more and you accept the cost of a fail (a 14-day wait and the full fee again). Otherwise follow Plan A. Book after you choose; check that the exam day plus five business days is before your deadline."}
